      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a professional email to the tenants in our Tokyo office building? We need to let them know the HVAC system is getting routine maintenance this weekend, so the temperature might be a bit inconsistent for a few hours. Keep it polite and formal.",
